{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17197","headline":"和王侍郎病中领度支烦迫之余过西园书堂闲望 · 权德舆","name":"和王侍郎病中领度支烦迫之余过西园书堂闲望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凭槛辍繁务，晴光烟树分。\n中邦均禹贡，上药验桐君。\n满迳风转蕙，卷帘山出云。\n锵然玉音发，余兴在斯文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}